1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Two BGP sessions are down. The other pair remains established.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Private-VM console samples show replies in both directions.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:26,000
The restore command asks Terraform to re-enable the two BGP peers.

4
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Terraform applies the BGP changes. This section plays at 3x speed.

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:38,667
The restore continues while the cloud console reports BGP status.

6
00:00:38,667 --> 00:00:44,667
GCP now shows all four BGP sessions established.

7
00:00:44,667 --> 00:00:50,667
The terminal shows restored peers and private-VM ping samples.

8
00:00:50,667 --> 00:00:56,000
AWS shows both tunnels UP on this VPN connection.

9
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,667
Tunnel logging is enabled. This footage was recorded before teardown.
